<section data-v-6bea8f81="" data-eid="380794" id="380794" href="" class="section py-m-50 py--45 p_relative full"><div data-v-4b3acc2c="" data-v-6bea8f81="" data-eid="382718" id="382718" href="" data-secondsdelay="" class="section_row"><div data-v-796cd32d="" data-v-4b3acc2c="" href="" data-secondsdelay="" id="ipnb0eb" class="row-column"><div data-v-8eb46620="" data-v-796cd32d="" data-eid="88981" href="" data-secondsdelay="" class="element-wrapper"><div data-v-8eb46620="" id="88981" href="" data-secondsdelay="" class="paragraph el-88981"><div href="" data-secondsdelay="" class="paragraph-inner"><p href=""><strong data-text="text" href="" data-secondsdelay="">Frequently Asked Questions</strong></p></div></div></div><div data-v-8eb46620="" data-v-796cd32d="" data-eid="71577" href="" data-secondsdelay="" class="element-wrapper"><div data-v-8eb46620="" id="71577" href="" data-secondsdelay="" class="scraped-container-wrapper"><div href="" data-secondsdelay="" id="i198tff" class="scraped-container el-71577 prdct_faq main_faq"><div href="" data-secondsdelay="" class="scraped-container-box cbox-71577-0"><div data-v-8eb46620="" data-eid="122488" href="" data-secondsdelay="" class="element-wrapper"><div data-v-8eb46620="" id="122488" href="" data-secondsdelay="" class="faq-wrapper"><div href="" data-secondsdelay="" id="iopad5h" class="faq el-122488"><div href="" data-secondsdelay="" id="i6e1ovo" class="faq-header"><div data-text="text" href="" data-secondsdelay="" id="i7jw7z9" class="faq-title">What is PrimeCell H2?
					  </div><svg fill="none" viewBox="0 0 15 15" height="15" width="15" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" href="" class="faq-icon"><path xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" fill-rule="evenodd" clip-rule="evenodd" d="M12.0581 4.55812L12.9419 5.44187L7.50001 10.8837L2.05814 5.44187L2.94189 4.55812L7.50001 9.11625L12.0581 4.55812Z" fill="currentColor" href="">
						</path></svg></div><div href="" data-secondsdelay="" class="faq-content-wrapper"><div href="" data-secondsdelay="" id="ibpdhap" class="faq-content"><div data-v-8eb46620="" data-eid="379958" href="" data-secondsdelay="" class="element-wrapper"><div data-v-8eb46620="" id="379958" href="" data-secondsdelay="" class="paragraph el-379958"><div href="" data-secondsdelay="" class="paragraph-inner"><p data-text="text" href="" data-secondsdelay="" id="ieov6a6">PrimeCell H2 is a molecular hydrogen tablet designed to support your body's natural antioxidant defenses as part of a daily wellness routine. Each tablet dissolves in water to release molecular hydrogen — one of nature's smallest antioxidants. PrimeCell H2 is formulated to support healthy cellular function and overall wellness when used daily.*
							  </p></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div data-v-8eb46620="" data-eid="493337" href="" data-secondsdelay="" class="element-wrapper"><div data-v-8eb46620="" id="493337" href="" data-secondsdelay="" class="faq-wrapper"><div href="" data-secondsdelay="" id="i8b3sa1" class="faq el-493337"><div href="" data-secondsdelay="" id="iyonovj" class="faq-header"><div data-text="text" href="" data-secondsdelay="" id="i9c4ekf" class="faq-title">Why should I take it?
					  </div><svg fill="none" viewBox="0 0 15 15" height="15" width="15" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" href="" class="faq-icon"><path xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" fill-rule="evenodd" clip-rule="evenodd" d="M12.0581 4.55812L12.9419 5.44187L7.50001 10.8837L2.05814 5.44187L2.94189 4.55812L7.50001 9.11625L12.0581 4.55812Z" fill="currentColor" href="">
						</path></svg></div><div href="" data-secondsdelay="" class="faq-content-wrapper"><div href="" data-secondsdelay="" id="it90yhf" class="faq-content"><div data-v-8eb46620="" data-eid="701771" href="" data-secondsdelay="" class="element-wrapper"><div data-v-8eb46620="" id="701771" href="" data-secondsdelay="" class="paragraph el-701771"><div href="" data-secondsdelay="" class="paragraph-inner"><p data-text="text" href="" data-secondsdelay="" id="i766wde">PrimeCell H2 is designed for adults who want to support their body's natural antioxidant systems and healthy aging as part of a consistent wellness routine. It's a simple daily foundation that complements clean eating, regular activity, and the rest of your supplement stack.*
							  </p></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div data-v-8eb46620="" data-eid="937691" href="" data-secondsdelay="" class="element-wrapper"><div data-v-8eb46620="" id="937691" href="" data-secondsdelay="" class="faq-wrapper"><div href="" data-secondsdelay="" id="ixnhpgb" class="faq el-937691"><div href="" data-secondsdelay="" id="ivqwlu6" class="faq-header"><div data-text="text" href="" data-secondsdelay="" id="ivzzjng" class="faq-title">What are the benefits?
					  </div><svg fill="none" viewBox="0 0 15 15" height="15" width="15" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" href="" class="faq-icon"><path xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" fill-rule="evenodd" clip-rule="evenodd" d="M12.0581 4.55812L12.9419 5.44187L7.50001 10.8837L2.05814 5.44187L2.94189 4.55812L7.50001 9.11625L12.0581 4.55812Z" fill="currentColor" href="">
						</path></svg></div><div href="" data-secondsdelay="" class="faq-content-wrapper"><div href="" data-secondsdelay="" id="imst2xv" class="faq-content"><div data-v-8eb46620="" data-eid="401526" href="" data-secondsdelay="" class="element-wrapper"><div data-v-8eb46620="" id="401526" href="" data-secondsdelay="" class="paragraph el-401526"><div href="" data-secondsdelay="" class="paragraph-inner"><p data-text="text" href="" data-secondsdelay="" id="ile0hgm">PrimeCell H2 supports your body's natural antioxidant defenses, healthy mitochondrial function, and steady daily energy — without caffeine or stimulants. It's formulated to support healthy cellular function and overall wellness as part of a daily routine.*
							  </p></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div data-v-8eb46620="" data-eid="236649" href="" data-secondsdelay="" class="element-wrapper"><div data-v-8eb46620="" id="236649" href="" data-secondsdelay="" class="faq-wrapper"><div href="" data-secondsdelay="" id="ivo2kme" class="faq el-236649"><div href="" data-secondsdelay="" id="i9neurx" class="faq-header"><div data-text="text" href="" data-secondsdelay="" id="ilk3mjt" class="faq-title">What is the best time of day to take PrimeCell H2?
					  </div><svg fill="none" viewBox="0 0 15 15" height="15" width="15" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" href="" class="faq-icon"><path xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" fill-rule="evenodd" clip-rule="evenodd" d="M12.0581 4.55812L12.9419 5.44187L7.50001 10.8837L2.05814 5.44187L2.94189 4.55812L7.50001 9.11625L12.0581 4.55812Z" fill="currentColor" href="">
						</path></svg></div><div href="" data-secondsdelay="" class="faq-content-wrapper"><div href="" data-secondsdelay="" id="i9cmgxi" class="faq-content"><div data-v-8eb46620="" data-eid="755983" href="" data-secondsdelay="" class="element-wrapper"><div data-v-8eb46620="" id="755983" href="" data-secondsdelay="" class="paragraph el-755983"><div href="" data-secondsdelay="" class="paragraph-inner"><p data-text="text" href="" data-secondsdelay="" id="irww4jh">Most people take PrimeCell H2 in the morning, but you can take it at whatever time fits your routine. Consistency matters more than timing — daily use supports your body's natural antioxidant systems over time. Dissolve one tablet in 12–16 oz of cool or room-temperature water, wait 60–90 seconds for full dissolution, and drink within 10 minutes.
							  </p></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div data-v-8eb46620="" data-eid="965163" href="" data-secondsdelay="" class="element-wrapper"><div data-v-8eb46620="" id="965163" href="" data-secondsdelay="" class="faq-wrapper"><div href="" data-secondsdelay="" id="idyfcvo" class="faq el-965163"><div href="" data-secondsdelay="" id="ize3qpz" class="faq-header"><div data-text="text" href="" data-secondsdelay="" id="ih6s6xz" class="faq-title">How many tablets are in a box?
					  </div><svg fill="none" viewBox="0 0 15 15" height="15" width="15" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" href="" class="faq-icon"><path xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" fill-rule="evenodd" clip-rule="evenodd" d="M12.0581 4.55812L12.9419 5.44187L7.50001 10.8837L2.05814 5.44187L2.94189 4.55812L7.50001 9.11625L12.0581 4.55812Z" fill="currentColor" href="">
						</path></svg></div><div href="" data-secondsdelay="" class="faq-content-wrapper"><div href="" data-secondsdelay="" id="idyo9qi" class="faq-content"><div data-v-8eb46620="" data-eid="782956" href="" data-secondsdelay="" class="element-wrapper"><div data-v-8eb46620="" id="782956" href="" data-secondsdelay="" class="paragraph el-782956"><div href="" data-secondsdelay="" class="paragraph-inner"><p data-text="text" href="" data-secondsdelay="" id="idb378g">Each box contains 30 effervescent tablets — a 30-day (1-month) supply at the recommended one-tablet-daily serving.
							  </p></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div data-v-8eb46620="" data-eid="21939" href="" data-secondsdelay="" class="element-wrapper"><div data-v-8eb46620="" id="21939" href="" data-secondsdelay="" class="faq-wrapper"><div href="" data-secondsdelay="" id="im9e92z" class="faq el-21939"><div href="" data-secondsdelay="" id="ixyuj17" class="faq-header"><div data-text="text" href="" data-secondsdelay="" id="i6sh2rk" class="faq-title">Does it contain caffeine?
					  </div><svg fill="none" viewBox="0 0 15 15" height="15" width="15" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" href="" class="faq-icon"><path xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" fill-rule="evenodd" clip-rule="evenodd" d="M12.0581 4.55812L12.9419 5.44187L7.50001 10.8837L2.05814 5.44187L2.94189 4.55812L7.50001 9.11625L12.0581 4.55812Z" fill="currentColor" href="">
						</path></svg></div><div href="" data-secondsdelay="" class="faq-content-wrapper"><div href="" data-secondsdelay="" id="imwvdr8" class="faq-content"><div data-v-8eb46620="" data-eid="805093" href="" data-secondsdelay="" class="element-wrapper"><div data-v-8eb46620="" id="805093" href="" data-secondsdelay="" class="paragraph el-805093"><div href="" data-secondsdelay="" class="paragraph-inner"><p data-text="text" href="" data-secondsdelay="" id="iw8ijyi">No. PrimeCell H2 contains no caffeine, stimulants, or artificial additives. It's designed to support your body's natural energy systems through daily antioxidant support — not stimulation. No jitters, no crashes.*
							  </p></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div data-v-8eb46620="" data-eid="119167" href="" data-secondsdelay="" class="element-wrapper"><div data-v-8eb46620="" id="119167" href="" data-secondsdelay="" class="faq-wrapper"><div href="" data-secondsdelay="" id="i05moma" class="faq el-119167"><div href="" data-secondsdelay="" id="iezprr5" class="faq-header"><div data-text="text" href="" data-secondsdelay="" id="ixm2czq" class="faq-title">How do I use it properly?
					  </div><svg fill="none" viewBox="0 0 15 15" height="15" width="15" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" href="" class="faq-icon"><path xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" fill-rule="evenodd" clip-rule="evenodd" d="M12.0581 4.55812L12.9419 5.44187L7.50001 10.8837L2.05814 5.44187L2.94189 4.55812L7.50001 9.11625L12.0581 4.55812Z" fill="currentColor" href="">
						</path></svg></div><div href="" data-secondsdelay="" class="faq-content-wrapper"><div href="" data-secondsdelay="" id="ia70s2t" class="faq-content"><div data-v-8eb46620="" data-eid="946161" href="" data-secondsdelay="" class="element-wrapper"><div data-v-8eb46620="" id="946161" href="" data-secondsdelay="" class="paragraph el-946161"><div href="" data-secondsdelay="" class="paragraph-inner"><p data-text="text" href="" data-secondsdelay="" id="itw0l8f">Drop one tablet into 12–16 oz of cool or room-temperature filtered water. Allow 60–90 seconds for full dissolution — you'll see effervescence as the tablet dissolves. Drink within 10 minutes for best results. Do not use hot water, as heat affects the dissolution process. Take daily as part of your wellness routine.
							  </p></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div data-v-8eb46620="" data-eid="418828" href="" data-secondsdelay="" class="element-wrapper"><div data-v-8eb46620="" id="418828" href="" data-secondsdelay="" class="faq-wrapper"><div href="" data-secondsdelay="" id="if7kqmz" class="faq el-418828"><div href="" data-secondsdelay="" id="iu6qwqk" class="faq-header"><div data-text="text" href="" data-secondsdelay="" id="i6a2fmx" class="faq-title">If I have a medical condition, can I take PrimeCell H2?
					  </div><svg fill="none" viewBox="0 0 15 15" height="15" width="15" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" href="" class="faq-icon"><path xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" fill-rule="evenodd" clip-rule="evenodd" d="M12.0581 4.55812L12.9419 5.44187L7.50001 10.8837L2.05814 5.44187L2.94189 4.55812L7.50001 9.11625L12.0581 4.55812Z" fill="currentColor" href="">
						</path></svg></div><div href="" data-secondsdelay="" class="faq-content-wrapper"><div href="" data-secondsdelay="" id="i35umzz" class="faq-content"><div data-v-8eb46620="" data-eid="749289" href="" data-secondsdelay="" class="element-wrapper"><div data-v-8eb46620="" id="749289" href="" data-secondsdelay="" class="paragraph el-749289"><div href="" data-secondsdelay="" class="paragraph-inner"><p data-text="text" href="" data-secondsdelay="" id="il18jff">If you have any health condition, take prescription medication, or are pregnant or nursing, please consult your healthcare provider before starting any new supplement, including PrimeCell H2.
							  </p></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div data-v-8eb46620="" data-eid="670934" href="" data-secondsdelay="" class="element-wrapper"><div data-v-8eb46620="" id="670934" href="" data-secondsdelay="" class="faq-wrapper"><div href="" data-secondsdelay="" id="ivxkqc9" class="faq el-670934"><div href="" data-secondsdelay="" id="im0qcjn" class="faq-header"><div data-text="text" href="" data-secondsdelay="" id="iop7zpg" class="faq-title">Where is it sourced from?
					  </div><svg fill="none" viewBox="0 0 15 15" height="15" width="15" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" href="" class="faq-icon"><path xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" fill-rule="evenodd" clip-rule="evenodd" d="M12.0581 4.55812L12.9419 5.44187L7.50001 10.8837L2.05814 5.44187L2.94189 4.55812L7.50001 9.11625L12.0581 4.55812Z" fill="currentColor" href="">
						</path></svg></div><div href="" data-secondsdelay="" class="faq-content-wrapper"><div href="" data-secondsdelay="" id="ic348oi" class="faq-content"><div data-v-8eb46620="" data-eid="171770" href="" data-secondsdelay="" class="element-wrapper"><div data-v-8eb46620="" id="171770" href="" data-secondsdelay="" class="paragraph el-171770"><div href="" data-secondsdelay="" class="paragraph-inner"><p data-text="text" href="" data-secondsdelay="" id="imwhoah">PrimeCell H2 is produced in a quality-controlled facility under strict manufacturing standards. Every batch undergoes third-party testing for purity and contaminant screening, including heavy metals. Certificates of Analysis are available on request.
							  </p></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div data-v-8eb46620="" data-eid="249825" href="" data-secondsdelay="" class="element-wrapper"><div data-v-8eb46620="" id="249825" href="" data-secondsdelay="" class="faq-wrapper"><div href="" data-secondsdelay="" id="i0vjyf6" class="faq el-249825"><div href="" data-secondsdelay="" id="ib7abda" class="faq-header"><div data-text="text" href="" data-secondsdelay="" id="icnkhpc" class="faq-title">How long does delivery take?
					  </div><svg fill="none" viewBox="0 0 15 15" height="15" width="15" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" href="" class="faq-icon"><path xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" fill-rule="evenodd" clip-rule="evenodd" d="M12.0581 4.55812L12.9419 5.44187L7.50001 10.8837L2.05814 5.44187L2.94189 4.55812L7.50001 9.11625L12.0581 4.55812Z" fill="currentColor" href="">
						</path></svg></div><div href="" data-secondsdelay="" class="faq-content-wrapper"><div href="" data-secondsdelay="" id="irs9b1i" class="faq-content"><div data-v-8eb46620="" data-eid="495250" href="" data-secondsdelay="" class="element-wrapper"><div data-v-8eb46620="" id="495250" href="" data-secondsdelay="" class="paragraph el-495250"><div href="" data-secondsdelay="" class="paragraph-inner"><p data-text="text" href="" data-secondsdelay="" id="iju228l">Orders are processed within 1–2 business days. Most customers receive their order within 7–14 business days, depending on location. You'll receive a tracking number as soon as your order ships so you can follow it every step of the way.
							  </p></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div data-v-8eb46620="" data-eid="389860" href="" data-secondsdelay="" class="element-wrapper"><div data-v-8eb46620="" id="389860" href="" data-secondsdelay="" class="faq-wrapper"><div href="" data-secondsdelay="" id="igsysgl" class="faq el-389860"><div href="" data-secondsdelay="" id="ivmi7zk" class="faq-header"><div data-text="text" href="" data-secondsdelay="" id="ippdhlg" class="faq-title">How soon will I feel the effects?
					  </div><svg fill="none" viewBox="0 0 15 15" height="15" width="15" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" href="" class="faq-icon"><path xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" fill-rule="evenodd" clip-rule="evenodd" d="M12.0581 4.55812L12.9419 5.44187L7.50001 10.8837L2.05814 5.44187L2.94189 4.55812L7.50001 9.11625L12.0581 4.55812Z" fill="currentColor" href="">
						</path></svg></div><div href="" data-secondsdelay="" class="faq-content-wrapper"><div href="" data-secondsdelay="" id="izi80yh" class="faq-content"><div data-v-8eb46620="" data-eid="808747" href="" data-secondsdelay="" class="element-wrapper"><div data-v-8eb46620="" id="808747" href="" data-secondsdelay="" class="paragraph el-808747"><div href="" data-secondsdelay="" class="paragraph-inner"><p data-text="text" href="" data-secondsdelay="" id="if3z7si">Some users notice they feel sharper or more steady within the first few days. Most people find that consistent daily use over 3–4 weeks helps support their wellness routine more noticeably. Like most wellness products, PrimeCell H2 works best with consistent daily use as part of a healthy lifestyle.*
							  </p></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div data-v-8eb46620="" data-eid="359879" href="" data-secondsdelay="" class="element-wrapper"><div data-v-8eb46620="" id="359879" href="" data-secondsdelay="" class="faq-wrapper"><div href="" data-secondsdelay="" id="i1343zj" class="faq el-359879"><div href="" data-secondsdelay="" id="i0kwl3f" class="faq-header"><div data-text="text" href="" data-secondsdelay="" id="ij2vgoh" class="faq-title">Is there a money-back guarantee?
					  </div><svg fill="none" viewBox="0 0 15 15" height="15" width="15" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" href="" class="faq-icon"><path xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" fill-rule="evenodd" clip-rule="evenodd" d="M12.0581 4.55812L12.9419 5.44187L7.50001 10.8837L2.05814 5.44187L2.94189 4.55812L7.50001 9.11625L12.0581 4.55812Z" fill="currentColor" href="">
						</path></svg></div><div href="" data-secondsdelay="" class="faq-content-wrapper"><div href="" data-secondsdelay="" id="iny25kw" class="faq-content"><div data-v-8eb46620="" data-eid="319984" href="" data-secondsdelay="" class="element-wrapper"><div data-v-8eb46620="" id="319984" href="" data-secondsdelay="" class="paragraph el-319984"><div href="" data-secondsdelay="" class="paragraph-inner"><p data-text="text" href="" data-secondsdelay="" id="i15y7kx">Yes. Your order is protected by our 90-day money-back guarantee. If you're not satisfied with PrimeCell H2, simply reach out within 90 days of delivery and return your order for a full refund. See for return details.
							  </p></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div data-v-8eb46620="" data-v-796cd32d="" data-eid="966388" href="" data-secondsdelay="" class="element-wrapper"><div data-v-8eb46620="" id="966388" href="" data-secondsdelay="" class="scraped-container-wrapper"><div href="" data-secondsdelay="" id="i91sihc" class="scraped-container el-966388 mt--40"><div href="" data-secondsdelay="" class="scraped-container-box cbox-966388-0"><div data-v-8eb46620="" data-eid="319412" href="" data-secondsdelay="" class="element-wrapper"><div data-v-8eb46620="" id="319412" href="" data-secondsdelay="" class="btn-container el-319412"><a id="fkt-link-044-1a9-853" data-id="fkt-link-b79-fba-8cd" title="BUY NOW &amp; SAVE" target="_self" action="choose" align="center" animate="" speed="" delay="none" loop="none" variantvalue="" data-secondsdelay="" data-minutesdelay="" replaceproductid="" billnow="false" href="#288038" offer="" upsell="" quantity="" price="" class="btn btn-v2 k_btn" style="cursor: pointer;"><div href="" data-secondsdelay="" class="btn-headline"><p data-text="text" href="" data-secondsdelay="">BUY NOW &amp; SAVE
